# Forbes + Sec-Forbes crontab — HARDENED restore 2026-06-23
# Restored from ~/crontab.backup.20260622-045759 (full 54 jobs) with:
#  - --max-time on every curl (40 per-minute, 90 mid, 120 daily) so a hung
#    endpoint can't stack runs / block indefinitely
#  - per-minute jobs staggered via `sleep` so they don't all fire at :00
#    (forbes 0-9s, sec-forbes 10-18s) — flattens the minute-boundary spike
#  - marketplace/product moved from * * * * * to */15 (was a heavy per-minute sync)
#  - the two brands offset on shared cadences (sec-forbes +20s)
# m h  dom mon dow   command

# ========================================
# Forbes (acneno) — Every Minute (staggered 0-9s, --max-time 40)
# ========================================
* * * * * sleep 0; echo "[$(date '+\%Y-\%m-\%d \%H:\%M:\%S')]" >> /var/log/cron/forbes-webhook-refresh.log && curl --max-time 40 -s -X GET "https://acnenosystem.com/api/marketplace/webhook/refresh" >> /var/log/cron/forbes-webhook-refresh.log 2>&1
* * * * * sleep 1; echo "[$(date '+\%Y-\%m-\%d \%H:\%M:\%S')]" >> /var/log/cron/forbes-webhook-reset.log && curl --max-time 40 -s -X GET "https://acnenosystem.com/api/marketplace/webhook/reset" >> /var/log/cron/forbes-webhook-reset.log 2>&1
